        "titolo_orig": "India's drug lifeline to Africa disrupted by Iran war",
        "testo_it": "La guerra in Iran interrompe le forniture di farmaci indiani verso i paesi africani.",
        "priorita": "Alta",
        "id_gruppo": 8,
        "link": "https://www.dw.com/en/india-s-drug-lifeline-to-africa-disrupted-by-iran-war/a-77318563?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf",
