        "link": "https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/focus/20260527-new-zealand-sees-brain-drain-to-australia-amid-stagnating-economy",
        "orario": "16:46",
        "timestamp": 1779893177,
        "contenuto_esteso": "New Zealand is facing a major brain drain. Even former prime minister Jacinda Ardern has chosen to relocate to Australia. Her decision has reignited a debate over the country's persistent struggle to retain its talent, against a backdrop of a stagnating economy and a soaring cost of living. Our Auckland correspondent Emma Garboud-Lorenzoni reports."
